{"results": [{"name": "Olipop", "entity_id": "6647FB92-9390-4B58-885B-86D96FF5BB6D", "types": ["urn:entity:brand"], "properties": {"akas": [], "description": "An innovative functional beverage company focused on providing a healthier alternative to traditional sodas by utilizing plant-based prebiotic fiber. Founded in 2018, the brand emphasizes digestive health without sacrificing the nostalgic taste and bubbly satisfaction of classic soft drinks. Its product line is crafted to be low-sugar, non-GMO, and inclusive of various dietary lifestyles, appealing strongly to health-conscious consumers. The brand maintains a modern, approachable identity, positioning itself as a staple in the growing functional beverage category.", "external": {"instagram": {"id": "drinkolipop"}}, "founded_year": "2018", "image": {"url": "https://images.qloo.com/i/6647FB92-9390-4B58-885B-86D96FF5BB6D-420x-auto.jpg"}, "short_description": "OLIPOP is a healthy prebiotic soda brand offering plant fiber-based, low-sugar, non-GMO, gluten-free, paleo, and vegan sodas with high fiber content.", "short_descriptions": [{"language": "en", "value": "A functional soda brand blending classic, nostalgic flavors with plant-based prebiotic fiber and low sugar content for improved digestive health."}, {"language": "es", "value": "Una marca de refrescos funcionales que combina sabores clásicos con fibra prebiótica de origen vegetal y bajo contenido en azúcar para una mejor salud digestiva."}, {"language": "de", "value": "Eine funktionelle Limonadenmarke, die klassische Aromen mit pflanzlichen präbiotischen Ballaststoffen und wenig Zucker für eine bessere Verdauungsgesundheit kombiniert."}, {"language": "fr", "value": "Une marque de sodas fonctionnels alliant saveurs nostalgiques, fibres prébiotiques végétales et faible teneur en sucre pour une meilleure santé digestive."}]}, "popularity": 0.7518095980742825, "disambiguation": "", "tags": [{"name": "Bright Color Palette", "tag_id": "urn:tag:aesthetic_property:q